Subject: [PATCH] feat(tools): Add ModelsLab image generation tool
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds ModelsLabImageGeneration as a new Tool node for Flowise,
following the CodeInterpreterE2B and BraveSearchAPI patterns.

- packages/components/nodes/tools/ModelsLabImageGeneration/ModelsLabImageGeneration.ts
  - ModelsLabImageGeneration_Tools (INode) — Flowise node definition
  - ModelsLabImageTool (StructuredTool) — LangChain tool with zod schema
  - Supports: Flux, Flux Pro, SDXL, SD 3.5, Realistic Vision, JuggernautXL
  - Key-in-body authentication (MODELSLAB_API_KEY)
  - Async polling: status=processing -> poll /images/fetch/{id} every 5s
  - Native fetch — no new dependencies

- packages/components/credentials/ModelsLabApi.credential.ts
  - ModelsLabApi credential (password field for API key)

Docs: https://docs.modelslab.com
